  "solution": "**Given:**\n\nDecimal Number: 0.234343434...\n\n**Calculation:**\n\nLet x = 0.234343434...\n\n⇒ 100x = 23.4343434...\n\n⇒ 100x - x = 23.4343434... - 0.2343434...\n\n⇒ 99x = 23.2\n\n⇒ x = 23.2 / 99\n\n⇒ x = (232)/(990)\n\n⇒ x = (116)/(495)\n\nA = 116 and B = 495.\n\nTherefore, B - A = 495 - 116 = 379.\n\n**The correct answer is option 1.**",
